  "description": "Pins the Myne dialect wikilink parser (src/dialect/lezer/wikilink.ts) — which byte ranges are recognized as Wikilink / WikilinkMark / WikilinkTarget / WikilinkAlias / WikilinkHeading / WikilinkBlockId. UTF-8 byte offsets. recognize cases carry the spans; inert cases carry an empty list. TS-runner category.",
